WEBVTT

00:06:59.989 --> 00:07:01.923
How did the industry respond?

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.529
And how did they respond

00:07:03.553 --> 00:07:06.633
in this historically
unregulated marketplace?

00:07:06.657 --> 00:07:08.887
Going back to the 1930s,

00:07:08.911 --> 00:07:13.990
it was with advertising
that heavily featured imagery of doctors

00:07:14.014 --> 00:07:15.926
and other health care professionals

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.084
sending messages of reassurance.

00:07:18.617 --> 00:07:20.252
This is an ad for Lucky Strikes,

00:07:20.276 --> 00:07:22.688
the popular cigarette
of the time in the '30s:

00:07:22.712 --> 00:07:27.010
[20,679 physicians
say "Luckies are less irritating."

00:07:27.322 --> 00:07:31.524
Your throat protection
against irritation, against cough.]